            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Let’s move on to the next step." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_tutorial_black",
      "type": "tutorial",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "There are different kinds of spheres. All of them must be collected, except the black ones." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Black spheres are dangerous." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Close the bins with SPACE to block the black sphere." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Then dodge it. Don’t catch it." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_tutorial_black_retry",
      "type": "tutorial_retry",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Close the bins with SPACE to block the black sphere." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Then dodge it. Don’t catch it." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_tutorial_black_success",
      "type": "tutorial",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Perfect." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Black spheres damage the ship." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Avoid collecting them at all costs." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_tutorial_flush_intro",
      "type": "tutorial",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Alright, let’s keep going." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "A bin empties when it holds five spheres." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "That’s the only moment when you score points." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Send the incoming blue sphere into the left bin and watch what happens." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_tutorial_flush_retry",
      "type": "tutorial_retry",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Send the incoming blue sphere into the left bin and watch what happens." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_tutorial_flush_success",
      "type": "tutorial",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Excellent!" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Look at the top of the screen. Your score went up, and your progress bar updated." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Some sphere combinations trigger combos. It’s up to you to discover them." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_tutorial_black_hull_intro",
      "type": "tutorial",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Last step. The important one." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "The right bin is contaminated by a black sphere." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "When you flush the bin, it will damage the ship." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Trigger the flush and see what happens." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_tutorial_black_hull_retry",
      "type": "tutorial_retry",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
