            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "We can start the mission." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "shop_welcome",
      "type": "shop",
      "world": 0,
      "level": 0,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "seller", "text": "Welcome to the shop. If you’ve got cash, I’ve got gear." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "seller", "text": "Shop’s open. If you want to survive, I’d suggest upgrading your ship." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "seller", "text": "Park your ship, grab a coffee, and leave the rest to us." }
          ]
        },
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "seller", "text": "Repairs, module installs, all kinds of upgrades. Take your time and gear up properly." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "W1_L1_intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Mike. Nice and easy for the first pass. Send everything into the collectors. Let the black ones go." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Got it. I won’t break anything." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "That would be a first." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Mike, do your job right. I’ve got a sudoku to finish." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Glad to see everyone’s relaxed. Alright, focus. I want a clean run." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L1_outro",
      "type": "outro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 1,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Alright… not bad. I’ve had worse first missions." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Of course not. That was the warm-up." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Stable flow. No surprises." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Works for me. If every mission is like this, I’m in." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Wait until you see the rest before you get cocky." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Stay focused. We’re still a long way from the end of this contract." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "W1_L2_intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 2,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Flow is a little faster than the last one." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Perfect. I was starting to get bored." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "You get bored for two minutes and start doing dumb shit." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "That’s not true. I start doing dumb shit way faster than that." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "The angles are less stable. Watch your rebounds." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Copy that." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Mike… I’m on puzzle 47 now." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "I can feel the weight of that responsibility." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Alright, enough. You can mess around later. Right now, we’ve got bins to fill." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L2_outro",
      "type": "outro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 2,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Alright… now it’s getting interesting." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Denser flow, but still stable." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "And my sudoku’s going great." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "You really do that while we’re working?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "I do it because you’re working." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Keep it up." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "W1_L3_intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 3,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Heavier flow in this sector." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Ah. So now we’re actually working." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "I’m seeing more black ones too." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Confirmed. Ratio is up." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Nothing to worry about." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Maybe. But we keep it clean." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "And after this… I hope the shop is worth the stop." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Oh, absolutely. My cockpit could use a few upgrades." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Finish this mission first." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L3_outro",
      "type": "outro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 3,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Alright… that one was a little more lively." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "More unstable flow." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Still manageable." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "And your sudoku?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Finished." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "I’m impressed." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "I knew you’d do one thing right eventually." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Alright. Next stop: the shop. I’m taking the chance to get a decent coffee." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "W1_L4_intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 4,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Heh… I walked out with the shop girl’s number." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "And I walked out with eight hours of sleep." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Next sector: Rockfall Corridor." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah, that name really inspires confidence…" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "There’s something strange in the scans." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Strange how?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Hard to say." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Fine. Then we stay sharp." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Copy that, Cap." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L4_outro",
      "type": "outro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 4,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Okay… can somebody explain what the hell just happened?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "I thought we were dead." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "That last wave… the black sphere ratio was way too high." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah, I noticed that much." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Mistake in the report?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Possible." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "It happens." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "I don’t like that kind of mistake." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Stay focused. We keep moving." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "W1_L5_intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 5,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Very heavy flow in this sector." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah… I can see that. And honestly, after what happened in the corridor, I’d rather know what’s coming." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "At least this time we’re ready." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Trajectories are unstable." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Great." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Keep a cool head. We do the job." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Copy that, Cap." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L5_outro",
      "type": "outro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 5,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Alright… I hope the next one’s the last, because this one really shook me up." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "You say that after every mission." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah, but this time I actually mean it." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "This sector is getting more and more unstable." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Really? Hadn’t noticed." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Stay focused, Mike. We’re close to the end of the zone." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Cap?" },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Later, Rye. We talk about it if we survive this mess." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "id": "W1_L6_intro",
      "type": "intro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 6,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "I’m confirming the scans… something’s wrong." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "What do you mean?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "This feels bad. Way too many black ones." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "That bad?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Yeah." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "How much are we even supposed to recover here?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Not enough to make me like it." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Great… so we might wreck the ship for scraps." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "We’re already here." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Cap…" },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "We take what’s worth taking and get out." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Understood." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Ah… this is gonna be fun. Can’t wait." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "W1_L6_outro",
      "type": "outro",
      "world": 1,
      "level": 6,
      "variants": [
        {
          "weight": 1,
          "lines": [
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Alright… I’m gonna ask the question everyone’s thinking." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Because that last sector…" },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "looked a hell of a lot like a place we were supposed to die in." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "The briefing data was accurate." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "What happened… matched the scans." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah, I got that." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "That’s exactly what worries me." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "..." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Rye?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "..." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "Say it." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "I don’t know." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "All I know is that for thirty seconds I watched those trajectories coming in, and it felt like we’d been sent exactly where we needed to be so we wouldn’t make it out." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "And I don’t like that feeling." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Statistically… it was a very bad mission." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "\"Bad\"?" },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "We almost lost the ship to recover what… a handful of spheres?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "..." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "And nobody thinks that’s weird?" },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "We signed on to recover." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Yeah." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "But when exactly are we supposed to get paid?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "When they call us back." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "And when is that?" },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "Six months." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Six months." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "So we spend six months flying through sectors like that…" },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "and then maybe we get paid." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "..." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Rye?" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Yeah. I’m thinking." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "Because I’m trying to figure something out." },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "If somebody wanted to send a crew out to get ground to pieces in some corner of space…" },
            { "speakerId": "rye", "text": "it would look a lot like what we just did." },
            { "speakerId": "leigh", "text": "That’s a possibility." },
            { "speakerId": "mike", "text": "Reassuring." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "That’s enough." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "We’re still alive." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "The ship’s still holding." },
            { "speakerId": "captain", "text": "And as long as that’s true… we keep going." }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },

